# SitGuru Admin workplace look

New or restyled Admin pages must match Growth / Referrals / Programs — not the old white “command center” walls.

## Required chrome
- Use `GrowthPageFrame` (or `AdminWorkplaceFrame` from `@/components/admin/AdminWorkplace`).
- Green header `#0D5C3A` with `public-dark-section` / `data-brand-green` and `!text-white` on titles. Never dark text on brand green.
- Color KPI tiles via `AdminThemeCard` (emerald / sky / amber / rose / violet / slate).
- Big action tiles via `AdminWorkplaceActions` — icon, short label, one-line detail. One primary green tile when there is work to do.
- Work queues and lists live in `GrowthCard` / `AdminWorkplaceCard`.
- Source health is a compact footer (`AdminWorkplaceHealth`), not a second hero.

## Do not ship
- Pale gradient “Pathways Command Center” heroes
- 12–16 identical white module cards with Live/Next badges
- Eight tiny white metric tiles in one row
- Long technical copy as the first thing on the page
- Grids that overflow the admin pane — use `min-w-0`, wrap text, stack before `xl`

## Copy
- Punchy workplace titles (“Turn X into Y”), not department slogans.
- Keep contractor / SkillBridge / Checkr legal notes short and in a notes card.
